      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There's an older request for negative voice gain: https://feedback.vrchat.com/udon/p/add-the-ability-to-have-negative-gain-for-player-voices\n\nWhile the suggested api is different, either of these would likely let us achieve the same things. The 0-1 SetVoiceVolume might be easier for people to understand",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
